7\u0633\u06cc"},"7":{"Display":"\u0645\u0642\u0627\u0645\u0627\u062a \u062f\u0648\u0644\u062a\u06cc"},"8":{"Display":"\u0627\u06cc\u0646\u0641\u0644\u0648\u0626\u0646\u0633\u0631\u0647\u0627 \u0648 \u0633\u0644\u0628\u0631\u06cc\u062a\u06cc\u200c\u0647\u0627"},"9":{"Display":"\u062f\u0648\u0633\u062a\u0627\u0646 \u0648\/\u06cc\u0627 \u0647\u0645\u06a9\u0627\u0631\u0627\u0646"},"10":{"Display":"\u0627\u0639\u0636\u0627\u06cc \u062e\u0627\u0646\u0648\u0627\u062f\u0647"}},"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"\u06a9\u0627\u0645\u0644\u0627\u064b \u0628\u06cc\u200c\u0627\u0639\u062a\u0645\u0627\u062f"}}},"FR":{"QuestionText":"[Q4] Dans quelle mesure faites-vous confiance \u00e0 l\u2019exactitude des nouvelles et des informations que vous recevez de\u2026 (\u00e9chelle de 1 \u00e0 7\u00a0: Totalement m\u00e9fiant\u2026 Totalement confiant)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Vos principaux m\u00e9dias d&#39;information"},"2":{"Display":"Des m\u00e9dias que vous ne rencontrez pas souvent"},"3":{"Display":"Les m\u00e9dias sociaux (tels qu&#39;Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, Twitter, etc.)"},"4":{"Display":"Groupes sur les applications de messagerie (telles que WhatsApp, Telegram, Signal, etc.)"},"5":{"Display":"Plateformes de podcasts (telles que Spotify, Apple Podcasts, etc.)"},"6":{"Display":"Les dirigeants politiques"},"7":{"Display":"Fonctionnaires publics"},"8":{"Display":"Influenceurs et c\u00e9l\u00e9brit\u00e9s"},"9":{"Display":"Amis et\/ou coll\u00e8gues"},"10":{"Display":"Membres de la famille"}},"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"M\u00e9fiance totale"}}},"HU":{"QuestionText":"[4. k\u00e9rd\u00e9s] Mennyire b\u00edzik a h\u00edrek \u00e9s inform\u00e1ci\u00f3k pontoss\u00e1g\u00e1ban, amelyeket a k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 forr\u00e1sokb\u00f3l szerez\u2026 (1\u20137-es sk\u00e1la: Teljesen nem b\u00edzom... Teljesen megb\u00edzom)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"A f\u0151 h\u00edrcsatorn\u00e1id"},"2":{"Display":"H\u00edrcsatorn\u00e1k, amelyekkel nem gyakran tal\u00e1lkozol"},"3":{"Display":"K\u00f6z\