Display":"\u6218\u4e89\u4e0e\u51b2\u7a81"},"6":{"Display":"\u56fd\u5bb6\u95ee\u9898\u3001\u4e8b\u4ef6\u548c\u516c\u4f17\u4eba\u7269"},"7":{"Display":"\u5546\u4e1a\u548c\u91d1\u878d"},"8":{"Display":"<meta charset=\"UTF-8\" \/>\u4f53\u80b2\u8fd0\u52a8"},"9":{"Display":"\u5a31\u4e50\u548c\u540d\u4eba"}},"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"1 - \u5b8c\u5168\u6ca1\u6709"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"},"6":{"Display":"6"},"7":{"Display":"7 - <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" \/>\u975e\u5e38\u591a"}}},"NL":{"QuestionText":"[Q6] Hoeveel<strong> <\/strong>Denkt u dat er valse of misleidende inhoud is gecre\u00eberd door buitenlandse actoren <strong>over elk van de volgende onderwerpen<\/strong>?<br \/>\nGeef een beoordeling van 1 (Helemaal geen) tot 7 (Heel erg)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Politiek en verkiezingen"},"2":{"Display":"Wetenschap en technologie"},"3":{"Display":"Noodsituaties, zoals schietpartijen of natuurrampen"},"4":{"Display":"Gezondheid en geneeskunde"},"5":{"Display":"Oorlogen en conflicten"},"6":{"Display":"Nationale problemen, gebeurtenissen en publieke figuren"},"7":{"Display":"Zaken en financi\u00ebn"},"8":{"Display":"Sport"},"9":{"Display":"Entertainment en beroemdheden"}},"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"1 - Helemaal geen"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"},"6":{"Display":"6"},"7":{"Display":"7 - Heel erg"}}},"ET":{"QuestionText":"[K6] <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" \/>Kui palju<b>\u00a0<\/b>on teie arvates v\u00e4lismaised\u00a0osapooled loonud\u00a0<strong>iga j\u00e4rgmise teema kohta<\/strong> valet v\u00f5i eksitavat sisu?<br \/>\nPalun hinnake skaalal 1 (Mitte \u00fcldse) kuni 7 (V\u00e4ga palju)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Poliitika ja valimised"},"2":{"Display":"Teadus ja tehnoloogia"},"3":{"Display":"H\u00e4daolukorrad, n\u00e4iteks tulistamised v\u00f5i loodus\u00f5nnetused"},"4":{"Display":"Tervis ja meditsiin"},"5":{"Display":"S\u00f5da ja konfliktid"},"6":{"Display":"Riiklikud teemad, s\u00fcndmused ja avaliku elu tegelased"},"7":{"Display":"\u00c4ri ja rahandus"},"8":{"Display":"Sport"},"9":{"Display":"Meelelahutus ja kuulsused"}},"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"1 \u2013 Mitte \u00fcldse"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"},"6":{"Display":"6"},"7":{"Display":"7 \u2013 V\u00e4ga palju"}}},"FR":{"QuestionText":"[Q6] Selon vous, quelle quantit\u00e9 de <strong>contenus faux ou trompeurs est cr\u00e9\u00e9e<\/strong> par des acteurs \u00e9trangers <strong>sur chacun des sujets suivants<\/strong> ?<br \/>\nVeuillez noter de 1 (Pas du tout) \u00e0 7 (\u00c9norm\u00e9ment)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Politique et \u00e9lections"},"2":{"Display":"Science et technologie"},"3":{"Display":"Urgences, telles que fusillades ou catastrophes naturelles"},"4":{"Display":"Sant\u00e9 et m\u00e9decine"},"5":{"Display":"Guerre et conflits"},"6":{"Display":"Questions nationales, \u00e9v\u00e9nements et personnalit\u00e9s publiques"},"7":{"Display":"Affaires et finances"},"8":{"Display":"Les sports"},"9":{"Display":"Divertissement et c\u00e9l\u00e9brit\u00e9s"}},"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"1 - Pas du tout"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"},"6":{"Display":"6"},"7":{"Display":"7 - \u00c9norm\u00e9ment"}}},"KAT":{"QuestionText":"[Q6] <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" \/>\u10d7\u10e5\u10d5\u10d4\u10dc\u10d8 \u10d0\u10d6\u10e0\u10d8\u10d7, \u10e0\u10d0\u10db\u10d3\u10d4\u10dc\u10d0\u10d3 \u10ea\u10e0\u10e3 \u10d0\u10dc \u10e8\u10d4\u10ea\u10d3\u10dd\u10db\u10d0\u10e8\u10d8 \u10e8\u10d4\u10db\u10e7\u10d5\u10d0\u10dc\u00a0\u10d8\u10dc\u10e4\u10dd\u10e0\u10db\u10d0\u10ea\u10d8\u10d0\u10e1\u00a0\u10e5\u10db\u10dc\u10d8\u10d0\u10dc \u10e3\u10ea\u10ee\u10dd\u10d4\u10da\u10d8 \u10d0\u10e5\u10e2\u10dd\u10e0\u10d4\u10d1\u10d8 <strong>\u10d7\u10d8\u10d7\u10dd\u10d4\u10e3\u10da \u10e8\u10d4\u10db\u10d3\u10d4\u10d2 \u10d7\u10d4\u10db\u10d0\u10e1\u10d7\u10d0\u10dc \u10d3\u10d0\u10d9\u10d0\u10d5\u10e8\u10d8\u10e0\u10d4\u10d1\u10d8\u10d7<\/strong>?\u00a0<br \/>\n\u10d2\u10d7\u10ee\u10dd\u10d5\u10d7, \u10e8\u10d4\u10d0\u10e4\u10d0\u10e1\u10dd\u10d7 1-\u10d3\u10d0\u10dc (\u10e1\u10d0\u10d4\u10e0\u10d7\u10dd\u10d3 \u10d0\u10e0\u10d0) 7-\u10db\u10d3\u10d4 (\u10eb\u10d0\u10da\u10d8\u10d0\u10dc)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"\u10de\u10dd\u10da\u10d8\u10e2\u10d8\u10d9\u10d0 \u10d3\u10d0 \u10d0\u10e0\u10e9\u10d4\u10d5\u10dc\u10d4\u10d1\u10d8"},"2":{"Display":"\u10db\u10d4\u10ea\u10dc\u10d8\u10d4\u10e0\u10d4\u10d1\u10d0 \u10d3\u10d0 \u10e2\u10d4\u10e5\u10dc\u10dd\u10da\u10dd\u10d2\u10d8\u10d0"},"3":{"Display":"\u10e1\u10d0\u10d2\u10d0\u10dc\u10d2\u10d4\u10d1\u10dd \u10e1\u10d8\u10e2\u10e3\u10d0\u10ea\u10d8\u10d4\u10d1\u10d8, \u10e0\u10dd\u10d2\u10dd\u10e0\u10d8\u10ea\u10d0\u10d0 \u10e1\u10e0\u10dd\u10da\u10d0 \u10d0\u10dc \u10e1\u10e2\u10d8\u10e5\u10d8\u10e3\u10e0\u10d8 \u10e3\u10d1\u10d4\u10d3\u10e3\u10e0\u10d4\u10d1\u10d4\u10d1\u10d8"},"4":{"Display":"\u10ef\u10d0\u10dc\u10db\u10e0\u10d7\u10d4\u10da\u10dd\u10d1\u10d0 \u10d3\u10d0 \u10db\u10d4\u10d3\u10d8\u10ea\u10d8\u10dc\u10d0"},"5":{"Display":"\u10dd\u10db\u10d8 \u10d3\u10d0 \u10d9\u10dd\u10dc\u10e4\u10da\u10d8\u10e5\u10e2\u10d4\u10d1\u10d8"},"6":{"Display":"\u10d4\u10e0\u10dd\u10d5\u10dc\u10e3\u10da\u10d8 \u10e1\u10d0\u10d9\u10d8\u10d7\u10ee\u10d4\u10d1\u10d8, \u10db\u10dd\u10d5\u10da\u10d4\u10dc\u10d4\u10d1\u10d8 \u10d3\u10d0 \u10e1\u10d0\u10d6\u10dd\u10d2\u10d0\u10d3\u10dd \u10db\u10dd\u10e6\u10d5\u10d0\u10ec\u10d4\u10d4\u10d1\u10d8"},"7":{"Display":"\u10d1\u10d8\u10d6\u10dc\u10d4\u10e1\u10d8 \u10d3\u10d0 \u10e4\u10d8\u10dc\u10d0\u10dc\u10e1\u10d4\u10d1\u10d8"},"8":{"Display":"\u10e1\u10de\u10dd\u10e0\u10e2\u10d8"},"9":{"Display":"\u10d2\u10d0\u10e0\u10d7\u10dd\u10d1\u10d0 \u10d3\u10d0 \u10ea\u10dc\u10dd\u10d1\u10d8\u10da\u10d8 \u10e1\u10d0\u10ee\u10d4\u10d4\u10d1\u10d8"}},"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"1 - \u10e1\u10d0\u10d4\u10e0\u10d7\u10dd\u10d3 \u10d0\u10e0\u10d0"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"},"6":{"Display":"6"},"7":{"Display":"7 - \u10eb\u10d0\u10da\u10d8\u10d0\u10dc"}}},"DE":{"QuestionText":"[Q6] Wie viele\u00a0falsche oder irref\u00fchrenden Inhalte, glauben Sie, werden von ausl\u00e4ndischen Akteuren <strong>zu den folgenden Themen<\/strong> erstellt?<br \/>\nBitte bewerten Sie von 1 (Gar keine) bis 7 (Sehr viel)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Politik und Wahlen"},"2":{"Display":"Wissenschaft und Technologie"},"3":{"Display":"<meta charset=\"UTF-8\" \/>Gro\u00dfe Ereignisse wie <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" \/>Amokl\u00e4ufe oder Naturkatastrophen"},"4":{"Display":"Gesundheit und Medizin"},"5":{"Display":"Kriege und Konflikte"},"6":{"Display":"Nationale Themen, Ereignisse und Pers\u00f6nlichkeiten des \u00f6ffentlichen Lebens"},"7":{"Display":"Wirtschaft und Finanzen"},"8":{"Display":"Sport"},"9":{"Display":"Unterhaltung und Prominente"}},"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"1 - Gar keine"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"},"6":{"Display":"6"},"7":{"Display":"7 - Sehr viel"}}},"HU":{"QuestionText":"[6. k\u00e9rd\u00e9s] V\u00e9lem\u00e9nye szerint mennyi hamis vagy f\u00e9lrevezet\u0151 tartalmat k\u00e9sz\u00edtenek k\u00fclf\u00f6ldi szerepl\u0151k <strong>a k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 t\u00e9m\u00e1kban<\/strong>? K\u00e9rj\u00fck \u00e9rt\u00e9kelje 1-t\u0151l (Egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n nem) 7-ig (Nagyon sokat)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Politika \u00e9s v\u00e1laszt\u00e1sok"},"2":{"Display":"Tudom\u00e1ny \u00e9s technol\u00f3gia"},"3":{"Display":"V\u00e9szhelyzetek, p\u00e9ld\u00e1ul l\u00f6v\u00f6ld\u00f6z\u00e9sek vagy term\u00e9szeti katasztr\u00f3f\u00e1k"},"4":{"Display":"Eg\u00e9szs\u00e9g\u00fcgy \u00e9s orvostudom\u00e1ny"},"5":{"Display":"H\u00e1bor\u00fa \u00e9s konfliktusok"},"6":{"Display":"Nemzeti \u00fcgyek, esem\u00e9nyek \u00e9s k\u00f6z\u00e9leti szem\u00e9lyis\u00e9gek"},"7":{"Display":"\u00dczlet \u00e9s p\u00e9nz\u00fcgy"},"8":{"Display":"Sport"},"9":{"Display":"Sz\u00f3rakoz\u00e