ie"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6"},"8":{"Display":"7"},"9":{"Display":"8"},"10":{"Display":"10\u00a0\u2014 Lab\u0113jie"},"11":{"Display":"9"}}},"IT":{"QuestionText":"[D26] In politica, le persone spesso si identificano come Sinistra o Destra. Utilizzando questa scala, <strong>dove ti collocheresti<\/strong><b>,<\/b> dove 0 indica la Sinistra e 10 la Destra?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0 - Sinistra"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6"},"8":{"Display":"7"},"9":{"Display":"8"},"10":{"Display":"10 - Destra"},"11":{"Display":"9"}}},"LT":{"QuestionText":"[26 klausimas] Politikoje \u017emon\u0117s da\u017enai save laiko kairiaisiais arba de\u0161iniaisiais. Naudodamiesi \u0161ia skale, kur 0 rei\u0161kia kair\u0119\u00a0<b>,<\/b> o 10 \u2013 de\u0161in\u0119, kur\u00a0<strong>save priskirtum\u0117te<\/strong>?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0 - Kair\u0117"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6"},"8":{"Display":"7"},"9":{"Display":"8"},"10":{"Display":"10 - De\u0161in\u0117"},"11":{"Display":"9"}}},"FA":{"QuestionText":"[\u0633\u0648\u0627\u0644 26] \u062f\u0631 \u0633\u06cc\u0627\u0633\u062a\u060c \u0645\u0631\u062f\u0645 \u0627\u063a\u0644\u0628 \u062e\u0648\u062f \u0631\u0627 \u0686\u067e \u06cc\u0627 \u0631\u0627\u0633\u062a \u0645\u06cc\u200c\u062f\u0627\u0646\u0646\u062f. \u0628\u0627 \u0627\u0633\u062a\u0641\u0627\u062f\u0647 \u0627\u0632 \u0627\u06cc\u0646 \u0645\u0642\u06cc\u0627\u0633\u060c <strong>\u062e\u0648\u062f\u062a\u0627\u0646 \u0631\u0627 \u062f\u0631 \u06a9\u062c\u0627 \u0642\u0631\u0627\u0631 \u0645\u06cc\u200c\u062f\u0647\u06cc\u062f<\/strong> <b>\u060c<\/b> \u06a9\u0647 \u062f\u0631 \u0622\u0646 \u06f0 \u0628\u0647 \u0645\u0639\u0646\u0627\u06cc \u0686\u067e \u0648 \u06f1\u06f0 \u0628\u0647 \u0645\u0639