K\u00e9rlek, \u00e9rt\u00e9kelj 0-t\u00f3l (Egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n nem fontos) 10-ig (Rendk\u00edv\u00fcl fontos)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0 \u2013 Egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n nem fontos"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6"},"8":{"Display":"7"},"9":{"Display":"8"},"10":{"Display":"9"},"11":{"Display":"10 \u2013 Rendk\u00edv\u00fcl fontos"}}},"IT":{"QuestionText":"[D30] Quanto \u00e8 importante per te <strong>vivere in un paese<\/strong> governato <strong>democraticamente<\/strong>?<br \/>\nSi prega di valutare da 0 (Per niente importante) a 10 (Estremamente importante)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0 - Per niente importante"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6"},"8":{"Display":"7"},"9":{"Display":"8"},"10":{"Display":"9"},"11":{"Display":"10 - Estremamente importante"}}},"KAT":{"QuestionText":"[Q30] \u10e0\u10d0\u10db\u10d3\u10d4\u10dc\u10d0\u10d3 \u10db\u10dc\u10d8\u10e8\u10d5\u10dc\u10d4\u10da\u10dd\u10d5\u10d0\u10dc\u10d8\u10d0 \u10d7\u10e5\u10d5\u10d4\u10dc\u10d7\u10d5\u10d8\u10e1 <strong>\u10d3\u10d4\u10db\u10dd\u10d9\u10e0\u10d0\u10e2\u10d8\u10e3\u10da\u10d0\u10d3<\/strong> \u10db\u10d0\u10e0\u10d7\u10e3\u10da <strong>\u10e5\u10d5\u10d4\u10e7\u10d0\u10dc\u10d0\u10e8\u10d8 \u10ea\u10ee\u10dd\u10d5\u10e0\u10d4\u10d1\u10d0<\/strong>?<br \/>\n\u10d2\u10d7\u10ee\u10dd\u10d5\u10d7, \u10e8\u10d4\u10d0\u10e4\u10d0\u10e1\u10dd\u10d7 0-\u10d3\u10d0\u10dc (\u10e1\u10d0\u10d4\u10e0\u10d7\u10dd\u10d3 \u10d0\u10e0 \u10d0\u10e0\u10d8\u10e1 \u10db\u10dc\u10d8\u10e8\u10d5\u10dc\u10d4\u10da\u10dd\u10d5\u10d0\u10dc\u10d8) 10-\u10db\u10d3\u10d4 (\u10eb\u10d0\u10da\u10d8\u10d0\u10dc \u10db\u10dc\u10d8\u10e8\u10d5\u10dc\u10d4\u10da\u10dd\u10d5\u10d0\u10dc\u10d8\u10d0)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0 - \u10e1\u10d0\u10d4\u10e0\u10d7\u10dd\u10d3 \u10d0\u10e0 \u10d0\u10e0\u10d8\u10e1 \u10db\u10dc\u10d8\u10e8\u10d5\u10dc\u10d4\u10da\u10dd\u10d5\u10d0\u10dc\u10d8"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6"},"8":{"Display":"7"},"9":{"Display":"8"},"10":{"Display":"9"},"11":{"Display":"10 - \u10e3\u10d0\u10e6\u10e0\u10d4\u10e1\u10d0\u10d3 \u10db\u10dc\u10d8\u10e8\u10d5\u10dc\u10d4\u10da\u10dd\u10d5\u10d0\u10dc\u10d8"}}},"LT":{"QuestionText":"[30 klausimas] Kiek jums svarbu gyventi <strong>demokrati\u0161kai<\/strong> valdomoje <strong>\u0161alyje<\/strong>?<br \/>\n\u012evertinkite nuo 0 (visai nesvarbu) iki 10 (nepaprastai svarbu)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0 \u2013 Visai nesvarbu"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6"},"8":{"Display":"7"},"9":{"Display":"8"},"10":{"Display":"9"},"11":{"Display":"10 \u2013 Nepaprastai svarbu"}}},"LV":{"QuestionText":"[30. jaut\u0101jums] Cik svar\u012bgi jums ir <strong>dz\u012bvot valst\u012b<\/strong> , kas tiek p\u0101rvald\u012bta <strong>demokr\u0101tiski<\/strong>?<br \/>\nL\u016bdzu, nov\u0113rt\u0113jiet no 0 (Nemaz nav svar\u012bgi) l\u012bdz 10 (\u0100rk\u0101rt\u012bgi svar\u012bgi)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0 \u2014 Nemaz nav svar\u012bgi"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6"},"8":{"Display":"7"},"9":{"Display":"8"},"10":{"Display":"9"},"11":{"Display":"10 \u2014 \u0100rk\u0101rt\u012bgi svar\u012bgi"}}},"NL":{"QuestionText":"[Q30] Hoe belangrijk is het voor u <strong>om in een land te wonen<\/strong> dat <strong>democratisch<\/strong> wordt bestuurd?<br \/>\nGeef een beoordeling van 0 (Helemaal niet belangrijk) tot 10 (Extreem belangrijk)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0 - Helemaal niet belangrijk"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6"},"8":{"Display":"7"},"9":{"Display":"8"},"10":{"Display":"9"},"11":{"Display":"10 - Extreem bela