 (V\u00e4ga religioosne).","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0 - \u00dcldse mitte religioosne"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6"},"8":{"Display":"7"},"9":{"Display":"8"},"10":{"Display":"9"},"11":{"Display":"10 - V\u00e4ga religioosne"}}},"FA":{"QuestionText":"<meta charset=\"UTF-8\" \/>[\u0633\u0648\u0627\u0644 32] \u0635\u0631\u0641 \u0646\u0638\u0631 \u0627\u0632 \u0627\u06cc\u0646\u06a9\u0647 \u0628\u0647 \u062f\u06cc\u0646 \u062e\u0627\u0635\u06cc \u062a\u0639\u0644\u0642 \u062f\u0627\u0631\u06cc\u062f \u06cc\u0627 \u062e\u06cc\u0631\u060c\u00a0<strong>\u062e\u0648\u062f\u062a\u0627\u0646 \u0631\u0627 \u0686\u0642\u062f\u0631 \u0645\u0630\u0647\u0628\u06cc \u0645\u06cc\u200c\u062f\u0627\u0646\u06cc\u062f<\/strong>\u00a0\u061f<br \/>\n\u0644\u0637\u0641\u0627 \u0627\u0632 \u06f0 (\u0627\u0635\u0644\u0627 \u0645\u0630\u0647\u0628\u06cc \u0646\u06cc\u0633\u062a\u0645) \u062a\u0627 \u06f1\u06f0 (\u06a9\u0627\u0645\u0644\u0627 \u0645\u0630\u0647\u0628\u06cc \u0647\u0633\u062a\u0645) \u0627\u0645\u062a\u06cc\u0627\u0632 \u062f\u0647\u06cc\u062f.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"\u06f0 - \u0627\u0635\u0644\u0627\u064b \u0645\u0630\u0647\u0628\u06cc \u0646\u06cc\u0633\u062a\u0645"},"2":{"Display":"\u06f1"},"3":{"Display":"\u06f2"},"4":{"Display":"\u06f3"},"5":{"Display":"\u06f4"},"6":{"Display":"\u06f5"},"7":{"Display":"\u06f6"},"8":{"Display":"\u06f7"},"9":{"Display":"\u06f8"},"10":{"Display":"\u06f9"},"11":{"Display":"\u06f1\u06f0 - \u0628\u0633\u06cc\u0627\u0631 \u0645\u0630\u0647\u0628\u06cc"}}},"FR":{"QuestionText":"[Q32] Que vous pratiquiez ou non une religion particuli\u00e8re, <strong>dans quelle mesure diriez-vous que vous \u00eates religieux<\/strong><strong>\u00a0<\/strong>?<br \/>\nVeuillez noter de 0 (Pas du tout religieux) \u00e0 10 (Tr\u00e8s religieux)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0 - Pas du tout religieux"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6"},"8":{"Display":"7"},"9":{"Display":"8"},"10":{"Display":"9"},"11":{"Display":"10 - Tr\u00e8s religieux"}}},"HU":{"QuestionText":"[32. k\u00e9rd\u00e9s] F\u00fcggetlen\u00fcl att\u00f3l, hogy gyakorol-e valamilyen vall\u00e1st, <strong>mennyire mondan\u00e1 mag\u00e1t <\/strong><meta charset=\"UTF-8\" \/><strong>vall\u00e1sosnak<\/strong>?<br \/>\nK\u00e9rlek, \u00e9rt\u00e9kelj 0-t\u00f3l (Egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n nem <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" \/>vall\u00e1sos) 10-ig (Nagyon <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" \/>vall\u00e1sos)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0 \u2013 Egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n nem <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" \/>vall\u00e1sos"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6"},"8":{"Display":"7"},"9":{"Display":"8"},"10":{"Display":"9"},"11":{"Display":"10 \u2013 Nagyon <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" \/>vall\u00e1sos"}}},"IT":{"QuestionText":"[D32] Indipendentemente dal fatto che tu pratichi o meno una religione in particolare, <strong>quanto diresti di essere <\/strong><b>religioso<\/b>?<br \/>\nSi prega di valutare da 0 (Per niente religioso) a 10 (Molto religioso)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0 - Per niente religioso"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6"},"8":{"Display":"7"},"9":{"Display":"8"},"10":{"Display":"9"},"11":{"Display":"10 - Molto religioso"}}},"KAT":{"QuestionText":"[Q32] <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" \/>\u10db\u10d8\u10e3\u10ee\u10d4\u10d3\u10d0\u10d5\u10d0\u10d3 \u10d8\u10db\u10d8\u10e1\u10d0, \u10db\u10d8\u10d4\u10d9\u10e3\u10d7\u10d5\u10dc\u10d4\u10d1\u10d8\u10d7 \u10d7\u10e3 \u10d0\u10e0\u10d0 \u10d9\u10dd\u10dc\u10d9\u10e0\u10d4\u10e2\u10e3\u10da \u10e0\u10d4\u10da\u10d8\u10d2\u10d8\u10d0\u10e1, <strong>\u10e0\u10d0\u10db\u10d3\u10d4\u10dc\u10d0\u10d3 \u10e0\u10d4\u10da\u10d8\u10d2\u10d8\u10e3\u10e0\u10d8 \u10ee\u10d0\u10e0\u10d7<\/strong>?\u00a0<br \/>\n\u10d2\u10d7\u10ee\u10d